er herself. It has a bad temper and likes to eat apricots. It follows its master's wishes and frolics about in the painting scroll, occasionally taking a bite out of it.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.9,"stats":{"hp":3200,"atk":330,"def":0,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.3}},"fury":{"slug":"fury","name":"'Fury'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Fury'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A strong Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. Large and robust, but not very good at thinking. Tends to fall into the simplest traps and needs Bitey to save its ass. Gains attack power against opposite attribute enemies.","abilities":["Greatly increases ATK when attacking opposite attribute targets"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":16000,"atk":1100,"def":750,"res":25,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"free":{"slug":"free","name":"'Free'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Free'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A monster drawn by Dusk. It has a commanding presence and chilling arrogance, as though taking a page out of its master's book. 'The virid beasts. Like range on range. Eleven told. In moon, smoke-flow.'","abilities":["First Form","[Weft and Warp] Deals Arts damage to targets in the surrounding cross area, changing Hui-Ming attributes within its range","[Break the Chains] Deals massive damage in a large radius if the Barrier is not destroyed before it expires.","The first time HP drops to 0, enters Second Form","Second Form","Changes own Hui-Ming Attribute","Gains increased ATK and normal attacks hit twice","Additionally unleashes [Weft and Warp] on farthest target"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":fal